    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome back to your roots.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3e <strong>A Farm You Build, A Life You Shape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve inherited a quiet piece of land and a rundown farm. It\u2019s not much at first, but it\u2019s yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s a lot to fix, a lot to build, and even more to figure out.<br>Work at your own pace, set your own goals, and make something real. One day, one choice, one goal at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is where it starts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585520/extras/90905a8ab94646ebb174f4bad89c8b69.poster.avif?t=1751491879\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585520/extras/90905a8ab94646ebb174f4bad89c8b69.webm?t=1751491879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>A World Where Everything You Do Matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming here isn\u2019t about repetitive clicks, it's about meaningful choices. Choose exactly<strong> where, when and how to plant your seeds</strong>, nurture your crops through sunny days and heavy rains, and watch your farm transform season by season. With over<strong> 30 different plant species to learn and grow, your land is yours to shape freely.\u00a0\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585520/extras/dddf6726007946ec335e49b8fe8ae9d1.poster.avif?t=1751491879\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585520/extras/dddf6726007946ec335e49b8fe8ae9d1.webm?t=1751491879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc13 <strong>Raise Animals with Real Personality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your farm isn't just crops and tools. It's a living, breathing place, home to animals with distinct personalities and behaviours. Intelligent animal systems offers a deep interaction with all farm animals! With over<strong> 20 animals in the game, the Farm always feels alive!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your animals from predators that roam at night; keep an eye open, or face the consequences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585520/extras/99c28de4349752a8c79824fa95cf7680.poster.avif?t=1751491879\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585520/extras/99c28de4349752a8c79824fa95cf7680.webm?t=1751491879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Design, Build, and Renovate.\u00a0Shape your farm, your way.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renovate more than just your house. Repair barns, rebuild fences, restore sheds, and bring every forgotten corner of the farm back to life. With over <strong>50 different in-world interactable items, 20 premade structures, and almost 100 freehand placeable items</strong> as Utility Items, Decorations and other Misc. items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re fixing the old or building something new, it all starts with your hands. Use the tools you\u2019ve crafted, the materials you\u2019ve gathered, and build every structure step by step. Full freedom to decorate, design, and create a farm that\u2019s truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585520/extras/89932fc99b9a8b25269db9ec68dea135.poster.avif?t=1751491879\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585520/extras/89932fc99b9a8b25269db9ec68dea135.webm?t=1751491879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude9a\u00a0<strong>Clear, Craft, and Expand Your Farm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the land, gather raw materials, and start building your farm from the ground up. Trim overgrowth, chop down trees, and turn logs into planks, stakes, and other essentials. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are 6 different crafting benches in the game each representing a different production process.</strong> From cooking to smelting and everything in between!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tools, machines, and vehicles!<strong> From basic gear to powerful tractors and ATVs</strong>, to get the job done your way. Everything you use, you earn. Everything you build, you built for a reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your resources to craft everything from simple decorations to functional structures that store goods, process items, or unlock new features. Upgrade your tools, expand your options, and shape the farm your way, piece by piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585520/extras/6900fdfc6e1d7951a006fac61cd845b8.poster.avif?t=1751491879\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585520/extras/6900fdfc6e1d7951a006fac61cd845b8.webm?t=1751491879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcb0 Sell, Trade, and Build Your Farm\u2019s Economy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your farm to life through buying, selling, and smart trading. Visit the <strong>Animal Market</strong> to buy livestock, trade animals, and grow your herd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your crops, crafted goods, and animal products to earn money. Then reinvest your profits into tools, upgrades, and land expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a range of shops: from the <strong>Farmer\u2019s Market</strong> to specialty stores where you can trade for seeds, supplies, rare items, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585520/extras/0286dba07609e56b915ba5e1a368a758.poster.avif?t=1751491879\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585520/extras/0286dba07609e56b915ba5e1a368a758.webm?t=1751491879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0e A Living, Breathing  World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The day/night cycle and changing seasons shape how you farm, explore, and plan ahead. From sunny harvests to stormy nights, nature plays a real role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step beyond your fields to visit markets, trade with neighbours, and pick up new supplies that help your farm grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your land, and the freedom to build the farm life of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585520/extras/6630f76cf4760bccf30b8feea641e8c1.poster.avif?t=1751491879\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585520/extras/6630f76cf4760bccf30b8feea641e8c1.webm?t=1751491879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to build the <strong>ultimate farm</strong>? <strong>Wishlist now and join the Hillshade Farm  community!\u00a0</strong></p>",
